    "description": "<p>Make a <strong>Spellcast Roll</strong> against a target within Far range. On a success, deal <strong>d8+4</strong> physical magical damage using your Proficiency.</p><p>Additionally, <strong>mark 2 or more Stress</strong> to make them permanently <em>Corroded</em>. While a target is <em>Corroded</em>, they gain a -1 penalty to their Difficulty for every 2 Stress you spent. This condition stacks.</p>",
